Derived code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

shared/tsdown.client.ts and shared/web-platform.ts are copied from dsh-pet
(https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-pet), Apache License 2.0, and are used
unmodified as the DSH client-bundle build preset. The DSH plugin structure
(host routes, settings.section registration, floating root) follows the
patterns of dsh-pet.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled and runtime third-party software
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

three.js (https://threejs.org) - MIT License. A subset is bundled into
lib/gltf-vendor.js.

glTF-Transform (https://gltf-transform.dev) - MIT License. Used by the import
pipeline.

meshoptimizer (https://github.com/zeux/meshoptimizer) - MIT License. Used for
mesh simplification.

sharp (https://sharp.pixelplumbing.com) - Apache License 2.0. Its prebuilt
binaries include libvips (LGPL-3.0-or-later), dynamically linked.

React - MIT License. Provided by the DSH host page, not bundled.

